      "description": "The Transport Infrastructure information product shows the classification of three road types: Arterial Roads, Collector Roads and Local Roads. The Transport Infrastructure dataset is based on Very High Resolution (VHR) satellite imagery (Quickbird-2 (2005) and Worldview-2, GeoEye-1 (2015, 2016)) by means of manual classification processing techniques.",
